VERSION 1.0
CANVAS 1280 720
STYLE handdrawn

SCENE 1 "Deterministic render controls"
  CREATE card AS RECTANGLE
    POSITION 400 300
    WIDTH 360
    HEIGHT 180
    COLOR #16324F
    FILL #DCECF1
    ROUGH on
    ROUGHNESS 1.4
    ROUGHSEED 17
    BOWING 0.8
    PENFOLLOW on
    DRAW 1s
  END
  INK gesture
    POINTS 700 420, 780 300, 900 400, 1040 260
    COLOR #D1495B
    FREEHAND on
    INKSIZE 11
    THINNING 0.35
    SMOOTHING 0.6
    STREAMLINE 0.45
    TAPER on
    PENFOLLOW on
    DRAW 1s
  END
END SCENE
